Z||000000||FOCOSEVA||07-23-2001||03:47 PM||||Greetings,<BR>If you've procrastinated, and haven't sent in your registration yet, shame on you. But there's still a way you can get registered in time. I've been authorized by Fiero Phil and Gloria to collect registrations. Send your registrations to me at the address listed below, and I will hand deliver them to Phil, unopened, at the Festival. Note - The last day I'm checking my mail is Thursday morning, August 2nd - after then I'll be at the Festival too. Last chance! Don't delay! Thanks for your consideration. Curry Obenshain<P>Fiero Festival<BR>P.O. Box 297<BR>White Marsh, Va. 23183||||reg||4
Z||000001||Formula88||07-23-2001||05:44 PM||||Is this for registering for the show?  I'm under the impression I can register at the door.  Is that incorrect?||||reg||1
Z||000002||FOCOSEVA||07-23-2001||08:12 PM||||This is the registration for the 2001 Fiero Festival in Williamsburg, Virginia. The cutoff date for (regular $45.00) registration is July 26, 2001. After that date, registration will be accepted at the door, but the price will be $50.00. Save yourself $5.00 and send in your registration now.  Curry Obenshain<P>Fiero Festival<BR>P.O. Box 297<BR>White Marsh, Va. 23183||||reg||1
Z||000003||LZeitgeist||07-30-2001||12:50 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>This is the registration for the 2001 Fiero Festival in Williamsburg, Virginia. The cutoff date for (regular $45.00) registration is July 26, 2001. After that date, registration will be accepted at the door, but the price will be $50.00. Save yourself $5.00 and send in your registration now. Curry Obenshain<BR>Fiero Festival<BR>P.O. Box 297<BR>White Marsh, Va. 23183<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>EDIT - problem in miscommunication seemingly solved. Apologies.<P><p>[This message has been edited by LZeitgeist (edited 07-30-2001).]||||reg||1
